OL,3,ADenmark accuses Russia of plotting to  
OL,4,Aassassinate US-Ukrainian rapper        
OL,6,FDenmark has accused Russian            
OL,7,Fintelligence services of plotting to   
OL,8,Fassassinate a Ukrainian-American near  
OL,9,FCopenhagen, saying they had "planned"  
OL,10,Fand "initiated" the attempt.           
OL,12,FDenmark's security and intelligence    
OL,13,Fagency said it had stopped individuals 
OL,14,Fwho were intending to kill the person, 
OL,15,Fnamed by Danish media as rapper        
OL,16,FKyivstoner, at a concert in September. 
OL,17,FTwo people were charged with attempted 
OL,18,Fmurder and assisting a foreign         
OL,19,Fintelligence service, and pleaded not  
OL,20,Fguilty.                                
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
